@startuml STM-5
!include _style.iuml
title STM-5 (System level) — Status of a CreditAccount\ncredit_accounts.status · v1.2 · 27/11/2026

[*] --> active
note left of active
  created with the Driver
  account (UC-ACC-01),
  balance 0
end note
active --> in_shortfall : session debited [balance < 0]\n/ block new app-billed sessions
in_shortfall : top-up credited [balance < 0]\n/ reduce shortfall
in_shortfall --> active : top-up credited\n[balance ≥ 0]
active -[dashed]-> closed : «planned» Driver closes the account (UC-ACC-02, T162)\n[no running or unsettled session (app or RFID),\nno open top-up, balance ≥ 0]\n/ refund unused credit (closure refunds, STM-10),\nwrite off the non-refundable rest, forfeit points,\nblock linked RFID cards (STM-8), disable login
closed --> [*]
note right of in_shortfall
  Closing is refused while the balance
  is negative (in_shortfall).
end note
note right of closed
  Not in code yet: no operation sets
  status = closed on main (27/11/2026);
  the ledger already treats a closed
  account as terminal (no debit, no
  settlement: account_closed, T158).
  "Unsettled" includes a stopped RFID
  session that has no charging
  statement yet (csms_billed).
  Refunds are created by the system
  at closure (requested_by empty);
  the Driver first sees a preview of the
  refundable and non-refundable amounts
  and the points forfeited.
end note
@enduml
